---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware | Lost Mailbox Key | 1st Capital Locksmith"
  description="Professional mailbox lock replacement throughout Delaware. 1st Capital Locksmith replaces mailbox locks for homes, apartments, and cluster mailbox units across Kent County — on-site service, new keys provided, upfront pricing. Call (302) 735-0050."
>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 flex-wrap">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Services</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">Mailbox Lock Replacement</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Schema: Breadcrumbs -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Services", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/services/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Mailbox Lock Replacement", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/services/mailbox-lock-replacement/" }
    ]
  })} />

  <!-- Schema: Service -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware",
    "description": "Professional mailbox lock replacement for residential mailboxes, apartment cluster mailbox units, wall-mounted boxes, and post-mounted mailboxes throughout Delaware. 1st Capital Locksmith provides on-site replacement with new keys across Kent County.",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "1st Capital Locksmith",
      "telephone": "+13027350050",
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "addressLocality": "Dover",
        "addressRegion": "DE",
        "addressCountry": "US"
      }
    },
    "areaServed": {
      "@type": "State",
      "name": "Delaware"
    },
    "serviceType": "Mailbox Lock Replacement"
  })} />

  <!-- Schema: FAQ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How much does mailbox lock replacement cost in Delaware?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Mailbox lock replacement is one of our most affordable services. The cost depends on the type of mailbox and lock. We provide a clear upfront quote before any work begins. Call (302) 735-0050 for a fast estimate."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you replace a cluster mailbox lock in an apartment complex?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. We replace individual unit locks in cluster mailbox units (CBUs) for apartment buildings, condominiums, and HOA communities throughout Delaware. We also work with property managers and landlords who need multiple units serviced."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "I lost my mailbox key — do I need to replace the whole mailbox?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. You only need to replace the lock cylinder inside the mailbox door — not the entire mailbox. We replace the lock on-site and provide new keys immediately. It's a quick, affordable service."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you open a mailbox if I don't have the key?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. We can open your locked mailbox without a key using non-destructive methods in most cases, then replace the lock and provide you with new keys on the same visit."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you replace mailbox locks for landlords and property managers?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. We regularly work with landlords and property managers throughout Delaware who need mailbox lock replacements at tenant turnover or when a tenant loses their key. We can service multiple units efficiently."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How long does mailbox lock replacement take?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A standard mailbox lock replacement takes approximately 15–20 minutes on-site. We handle the entire job at your property and provide new keys before we leave."
        }
      }
    ]
  })} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative min-h-[340px] md:min-h-[500px] flex items-center text-white py-10 md:py-20"
    style="background-image: url('/images/mailbox-lock-replacement.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/72"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-6 z-10">
      <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-xs md:text-sm mb-2 md:mb-4">Mailbox Lock Replacement — Delaware</p>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 md:mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware — Lost Your Key? We'll Have You Back In Minutes.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-5 md:mb-8">
        Lost mailbox key? Broken or damaged lock? Moved into a new home and not sure who has your mailbox key? 1st Capital Locksmith replaces mailbox locks for homeowners, renters, and property managers throughout Delaware — quickly, affordably, and with new keys provided on the spot.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a
          href="tel:3027350050"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-bold text-base md:text-lg hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
        >
          Call (302) 735-0050
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-semibold text-sm md:text-base hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A1F22] transition"
        >
          Get a Free Quote
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <section class="bg-[#0E1B2F] py-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">All Mailbox Types</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Post, Wall, Cluster & Apartment Units</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Fast Service</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Most Jobs Done in 15–20 Minutes</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Keys Provided</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">New Keys Cut On-Site</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Upfront Pricing</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Clear Quote Before We Start</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Delaware's Mailbox Lock Replacement Experts</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6 leading-snug">
            Mailbox Lock Replacement Service Throughout Delaware
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Your mailbox might be a small thing, but what it protects isn't. Bank statements, credit card offers, medical bills, tax documents, insurance notices — your mailbox handles a steady stream of sensitive personal and financial information every week. A broken lock, a lost key, or uncertainty about who has access is a real privacy and identity security concern, not just a minor inconvenience.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            1st Capital Locksmith provides professional mailbox lock replacement throughout Delaware for homeowners, apartment renters, landlords, and property managers. We work on all common mailbox types — standard post-mounted residential mailboxes, wall-mounted boxes, cluster mailbox units (CBUs) in apartment complexes and HOA communities, and high-capacity mail slots. We come to your property, replace the lock on-site, and provide new keys before we leave.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            It's one of our quickest services — most mailbox lock replacements take 15 to 20 minutes on-site — but the peace of mind it provides is well worth the short time it takes. We serve homeowners, renters, and property managers throughout Dover, Milford, Smyrna, Camden, Harrington, and all of Kent County, Delaware.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Photo Slot 1 -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-[#F8F8F5] aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/mailbox-lock-replacement-service.jpg"
              alt="Professional mailbox lock replacement service in Delaware"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="600"
              height="450"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">When You Need a Mailbox Lock Replacement:</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                "Lost or Missing Mailbox Key",
                "Broken or Damaged Mailbox Lock",
                "Key Won't Turn in Mailbox Lock",
                "Moving Into a New Home or Apartment",
                "Tenant Moved Out — Key Not Returned",
                "Stolen Mailbox Key",
                "Lock Jammed or Stuck",
                "Moving Into a New Rental Unit",
                "Security Concern About Who Has Key",
                "Worn-Out Lock That Won't Open Reliably",
              ].map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700">
                  <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
              <a
                href="tel:3027350050"
                class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 text-white font-bold hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
              >
                Call (302) 735-0050 Now
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Types Detail -->
  <section id="services" class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Mailbox Types We Service</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">
          Mailbox Lock Replacement Services in Delaware
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Different mailbox types require different approaches. Here's a breakdown of the mailbox lock situations we handle throughout Delaware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">

        <!-- Residential Post-Mounted Mailbox -->
        <div id="post-mounted" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Residential Post-Mounted Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              The standard post-mounted mailbox at the end of a driveway or along the street is the most common type throughout Delaware. These typically use a small cam-style lock cylinder that's straightforward to replace once you have the right replacement lock and the tools to access the interior of the box. Without the key, getting inside to remove the old lock requires careful non-destructive entry — forcing it will damage the mailbox door.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith replaces post-mounted residential mailbox locks throughout Delaware. We come to your property, open the box if needed, remove the old lock cylinder, install a new one, and provide you with new keys on the spot. The whole process typically takes 15 to 20 minutes and the cost is very reasonable.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Whether you've lost your key, your lock is worn out, you've just moved in, or you've had a security concern about previous key copies, we handle it cleanly and affordably. Call us at (302) 735-0050 and we'll get it sorted quickly.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Wall-Mounted Mailbox -->
        <div id="wall-mounted" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 9.75L12 3l9 6.75V21a1 1 0 01-1 1H4a1 1 0 01-1-1V9.75z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 22V12h6v10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Wall-Mounted Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Wall-mounted mailboxes, commonly found on the exterior of homes and townhouses near the front door, come in a variety of styles and lock configurations. Some use small padlock-style cylinders, others have built-in cam locks, and some older models use unique lock formats that require specific replacement parts. The variety of wall-mounted mailbox designs means the approach varies by box type.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Our locksmiths are experienced with all common wall-mounted mailbox lock types found in Delaware homes. We assess the specific lock configuration on your box, source the correct replacement cylinder, and complete the replacement on-site. If your box uses a less common lock format that requires a special order, we'll let you know upfront.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Lost your key and need access to get your mail today? We can open the box using non-destructive methods before replacing the lock, so you don't miss any important mail during the process.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Cluster Mailbox Units -->
        <div id="cluster-cbu" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Cluster Mailbox Unit (CBU) Lock Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Cluster Mailbox Units — the multi-unit metal mailbox banks common in apartment complexes, condominium communities, townhouse developments, and HOA neighborhoods throughout Delaware — use individual lock cylinders for each resident's compartment plus separate parcel compartment locks. These locks are standardized to a limited number of keyway types, making replacement straightforward for an experienced locksmith.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith replaces individual CBU compartment locks for residents who have lost their keys, and we also work with property managers and HOA maintenance teams who need multiple units serviced at once. If you manage a property with CBU mailboxes and need locks changed at tenant turnover or after keys are not returned, we can efficiently handle a full building's worth in a single visit.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              We carry common CBU lock replacement cylinders on our vehicles and provide new keys immediately after installation. Call us and describe your CBU setup — we'll confirm compatibility and give you an accurate estimate before we arrive.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Lost Mailbox Key -->
        <div id="lost-key" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Lost Mailbox Key Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Losing a mailbox key is one of the most common calls we get — and it's often treated as a minor hassle, when in reality it deserves prompt attention. Your mailbox handles personal, financial, and medical mail every day. A lost key means someone out there potentially has access to all of that. The right response isn't just to find a spare — it's to replace the lock so the lost key no longer works.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              When you call us for a lost mailbox key situation, we come to your property, open the locked mailbox using professional non-destructive methods, replace the lock cylinder, and provide you with two new keys on the spot. You're left with a fresh lock that only your new keys open — full control of your mailbox security restored in a single visit.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              If you're also not sure whether your lost key had any identifying information attached to it — a tag, a keychain from a local business — err on the side of caution and get the lock changed. It's a small investment for complete peace of mind.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tenant Turnover -->
        <div id="tenant-turnover" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H4a4 4 0 00-4 4v2h5m6 0v-4m0 0a4 4 0 10-8 0m8 0a4 4 0 108 0" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Mailbox Lock Replacement at Tenant Turnover in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Landlords and property managers who <a href="/services/lock-change/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">change the door locks</a> between tenants should also be changing the mailbox lock. An outgoing tenant may have made copies of the mailbox key — or simply kept it — and if the new tenant receives sensitive mail that the previous tenant can access, that's a serious privacy problem that exposes both the tenant and the landlord to liability.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith includes mailbox lock replacement as part of our tenant turnover locksmith service throughout Delaware. We can change the door locks and the mailbox lock in a single efficient visit, ensuring your new tenant has complete security on everything from day one. For landlords managing multiple properties or apartment complexes with CBU mailboxes, we handle multi-unit jobs efficiently.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              If you're a landlord or property manager in Kent County, call us to discuss what we can do to make your turnover process more secure and streamlined. We offer reliable, consistent service that portfolio landlords count on.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Damaged or Jammed Lock -->
        <div id="damaged-lock" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Damaged or Jammed Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Mailbox locks are small, relatively simple mechanisms, but they're also exposed to the elements year-round — rain, humidity, temperature extremes, and road salt in winter all take a toll. A lock that's seized up, corroded, or difficult to turn is a common problem in Delaware, particularly in older mailboxes that have never had the lock replaced.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              When a mailbox lock is jammed or damaged, the key may not turn, may turn without engaging the latch, or may require significant force that risks breaking the key off inside. If you're fighting with your mailbox lock every day, it's time to replace it. A new lock will operate smoothly and reliably, and the cost is minimal.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              We can also open a jammed or locked mailbox without a key before the replacement if needed — so you don't miss your mail while we handle the lock change. Call (302) 735-0050 and we'll schedule a visit at your convenience.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
